# SPOKU

Laravel 12 + Breeze Blade. Parked at `https://spoku.test`. MySQL `spoku`. Design tokens live in `resources/css/app.css` (`spoku-*` classes).

Read only the rule for the module you are changing:

| Module | Rule | When |
|---|---|---|
| Auth | `auth.mdc` | register, login, profile |
| Roles | `roles.mdc` | `UserRole`, middleware, dashboard redirect |
| Complaints | `complaints.mdc` | status flow, filings, approver votes, admin publish |
| Staff | `staff.mdc` | staff CRUD, assignments, team, directory |
| Public | `public.mdc` | feed and reactions |

Do not republish a complaint from approver votes. Admin publishes. Do not add a role without updating `UserRole`, routes, team, and directory together.
